  "description": "Roslyn analyzers for OpenApiFeatureFlags. Catches at build time the cases that used to fail silently at document time: a gate fragment without a flag attribute, a literal <gate> in an XML comment under NSwag (the reader drops it, so the fragment leaks in every flag state), a gated minimal API parameter under the built-in engine, and [OpenApiFeatureFlag] on a FastEndpoints endpoint. Install alongside the adapter package you use.",
